\fs28 \cf2 \cb5 \'93Restore the Plan on Earth\'94 is the closing phrase of Alice Bailey\'92s\'a0
\f2\b Great Invocation
\f0\b0 , a New Age/Theosophical prayer published in April 1945:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf2 \cb5 \strokec2 \'93Let Light and Love and Power restore the Plan on Earth.\'94\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa165\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf2 \cb5 \strokec2 In Bailey\'92s vocabulary, the capitalized\'a0
\f2\b Plan
\f0\b0 \'a0is a technical term. It means the divine purpose or spiritual blueprint underlying humanity\'92s evolution\'97not a particular political program or a detailed schedule of future events. Lucis Trust describes it as \'93the blueprint of divine Purpose,\'94 which must be worked out through humanity\'92s free participation rather than imposed by the spiritual \'93Hierarchy.\'94\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lucistrust.org/the_great_invocation/history_1"}}{\fldrslt 
\f1 \cf7 \cb1 \strokec7 \
