\cf2 \cb5 The whole Invocation builds toward that final line:\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf2 \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Light
\f0\b0 \'a0is asked to enter human minds: illumination, understanding, and freedom from ignorance.\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Love
\f0\b0 \'a0is asked to enter human hearts: relationship, compassion, and concern for the whole rather than the isolated self.\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Power
\f0\b0 \'a0means spiritual will or the \'93will-to-good\'94: the ability to translate understanding and love into action, rather than power as domination.\cb1 \
