\fs28 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A4 is compelling, but the reversal is objectively testable.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 I have tested it.  \cb1 \
\cb3 Agree that it doesn't need a page. can it be added somewhere else?\cb1 \
\cb3 B3 - she is too small to have her own page but maybe she could be referenced as possible influence, potential resolution within the other feminine \cb1 \
\cb3 C3 - it has a lines and concepts that directly parallel Move to You.  It does not share obvious structure with the SOL, but I have often said Move to You already seems to be a SOL.  These three songs are tangled for sure.  Note the parallels to move to you.  Move to You says love is a question.  the only song of love lyric we know is "love is a question, everyone's guessing, everyone knows. Love"\cb1 \
\cb3 C5 - do not downgrade.  if anything we should be examining this further.  as an artist and lyricist this is exactly where the symbolism lives.  \cb1 \
\cb3 C7. He has stated in interviews, check transcripts if you need to see discussion of recognizing the shadow within during the earlier years.  The sound is strings, electronic strings, tensions, saddness, confusion....did NOT hear the dies irea but its the kind of thing that would surround it.  \cb1 \
\cb3 C8. the great invocation is grounded.  it was placed very intentionally.  The danger of C8 is inflation along a slippery chain: he sings the Invocation \uc0\u8594  he's a Bailey adherent \u8594  Lucius is named for Lucis Trust \u8594  the project is Bailey doctrine. Every link past the first is unsupported, and the last is exactly the cult-mythology drift the anti-patterns forbid. There's also a public-vault hazard worth naming plainly: "Roy sings the prayer of a Lucifer-adjacent organization" is a sensationalizable framing in the wrong hands, so this stays SOURCE-side; nothing in the plan sends it toward the Field Guide.\cb1 \
\cb3 First this project aims to be academic but it is not, it is a fan project.  So, sometimes when things are just things we don't have to prove them academically.  This project IS heavily influenced by Bailey.  Bailey is not the only influence. We don't have to justify that position, its apparent.  Much of the project can be read through Bailey and if something conflicts hard its probably being interpreted incorrectly.  That said many other traditions are borrowed from...some that Bailey also borrowed from.  It is a project that aligns with bailey but it is not Bailey.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Restore the plan on earth is a woman's voice....In fact I believe its likely pulled from this page and altered slightly \cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 The voice and cadence sound just like this version.  \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Second, we do not need to protect roy from being associated with Lucifer.  we are at least acedemic enough to follow the trails faithfully wherever they lead.  The connection should be made because the path was laid out.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'85\cb1 \
